+
+**Files:** Modify `src/DemoTodo/TodoStore.cs`, `tests/DemoTodo.Tests/TodoStoreTests.cs`, `tests/DemoTodo.Tests/TodoApiTests.cs`.
+
+**Interfaces:** Extend `Todo(int Id, string Title, bool Done, DateOnly? DueDate = null)` and `NewTodo(string? Title, DateOnly? DueDate = null)`. Add computed `bool Todo.IsOverdue`. Keep `TodoPatch(string? Title, bool? Done)` compatible, adding an init-only nullable `DueDate` whose setter marks a `[JsonIgnore] bool HasDueDate` property. `TodoStore.Update` uses that presence flag.
+
+- [x] Write failing API tests using raw JSON/JsonElement, so missing behavior fails assertions rather than requiring new types to compile. Check POST dates are returned by POST/GET/list, and omission/null create undated todos.
+- [x] Add PATCH lifecycle assertions: set a date on an undated todo, replace it, preserve it on title/done-only patches, clear with null, and verify each saved result through GET. Example assertions:
+
+```csharp
+Assert.Equal("2024-02-29", json.GetProperty("dueDate").GetString());
+Assert.Equal(JsonValueKind.Null, cleared.GetProperty("dueDate").ValueKind);
+Assert.Equal(HttpStatusCode.BadRequest, invalid.StatusCode);
+```
+
+- [x] Add theory cases for impossible dates `2026-02-30`, `2025-02-29`, malformed strings, empty strings, timestamps, numeric/object values; test POST and PATCH, error property and unchanged store. Include a valid leap day `2024-02-29`.
+- [x] Run `dotnet test --filter FullyQualifiedName~TodoApiTests`; confirm the new date assertions fail before implementation.
+- [x] Implement the record changes and store date updates; use built-in DateOnly JSON conversion and the existing BadHttpRequestException middleware. Do not add redundant string parsing or new packages. Add store tests for date changes, preserved fields and computed overdue boundaries using yesterday/today/tomorrow in UTC, done and undated todos.
+- [x] Update the existing exact JSON response assertion for additive `dueDate:null,isOverdue:false` fields. Run `dotnet test`; require all tests passing, including original behavior.
+- [x] Commit model and tests: `feat: add optional todo due dates and overdue status`.
+
+### Task 2: Shared overdue filter and API query
+
+**Files:** Modify `src/DemoTodo/TodoStore.cs`, `src/DemoTodo/Program.cs`, `tests/DemoTodo.Tests/TodoStoreTests.cs`, `tests/DemoTodo.Tests/TodoApiTests.cs`.
+
