+- [x] Assert completing one past-due todo and clearing the other's date makes the filtered list empty; verify original records remain in the unfiltered list. Run `dotnet test --filter FullyQualifiedName~TodoApiTests`; observe failures for the ignored filter.
+- [x] Implement the store filter and query binding. Add direct store tests covering identical mixed-list selection and empty results.
